{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27545","headline":"南宫叹亦述玄宗追恨太真妃事 · 张祜","name":"南宫叹亦述玄宗追恨太真妃事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北陆冰初结，南宫漏更长。\n何劳却睡草，不验返魂香。\n月隐仙娥艳，风残梦蝶扬。\n徒悲旧行迹，一夜玉堦霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}